  "question": {
    "text": "During Kinetic study of reaction \\(2 A+B \\rightarrow C+D\\), the following results were obtained :\n\\(\\begin{array}{llll} \n& \\text { A [M] } & \\text { B [M] } & \\text { initial rate of formation of D } \\\\\n\\text { I } & 0.1 & 0.1 & 6.0 \\times 10^{-3} \\\\\n\\text { II } & 0.3 & 0.2 & 7.20 \\times 10^{-2} \\\\\n\\text { III } & 0.3 & 0.4 & 2.88 \\times 10^{-1} \\\\\n\\text { IV } & 0.4 & 0.1 & 2.40 \\times 10^{-2} \\\\\n\\end{array}\\)\nBased on above data, overall order of the reaction is ______",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "3",
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\begin{aligned} & \\mathrm{r}=\\mathrm{K}[\\mathrm{A}]^{\\mathrm{x}}[\\mathrm{B}]^{\\mathrm{y}} \\\\ & (\\mathrm{I}) 6 \\times 10^{-3}=\\mathrm{K}[0.1]^{\\mathrm{x}}[0.1]^{\\mathrm{y}} \\\\ & (\\mathrm{IV}) 2.4 \\times 10^{-2}=\\mathrm{K}[0.4]^{\\mathrm{x}}[0.1]^{\\mathrm{y}} \\\\ & \\quad(\\mathrm{IV}) /(\\mathrm{I}) \\\\ & 4=(4)^{\\mathrm{x}} \\\\ & \\quad \\mathrm{x}=1 \\\\ & \\mathrm{r}=\\mathrm{K}[\\mathrm{A}]^{\\mathrm{x}}[\\mathrm{B}]^{\\mathrm{y}}\\end{aligned}$\n$\\begin{aligned} & \\text { (III) } 2.88 \\times 10^{-1}=\\mathrm{K}[0.3]^{\\mathrm{x}}[0.4]^{\\mathrm{y}} \\\\ & \\text { (II) } 7.2 \\times 10^{-2}=\\mathrm{K}[0.3]^{\\mathrm{x}}[0.2]^{\\mathrm{y}} \\\\ & \\text { (III)/(II) }\\end{aligned}$\n$\\begin{aligned} & 4=2^y \\\\ & y=2\\end{aligned}$\nOverall order $=x+y=1+2=3$",
    "image": null
  },
